  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Hungarian Assisted Voluntary Return, Reintegration and Information Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed project aims to support safe and dignified voluntary return from Hungary and to promote the sustainable reintegration of eligible migrants in their countries of origin. It also aims at informing and further enhancing assisted voluntary return and reintegration programming through data collection and analysis on the return process and the respective support measures received before departure, during travel or upon return.</narrative>
  </description>
